            "detailed_description": "Enjoy a calm but challenging adventure exploring a beautiful dream world. Our hero Finn got lost, guide him and his friends to freedom! <br><br>Relaxing but intense challenges. Travel through islands with different environments and beautiful music.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Long gameplay and replayable levels.<br></li><li>Unlockeable characters with unique abilities that can be upgraded.<br></li><li>Hidden treasures.<br></li><li>Unique levels, different ways to finish some of them.<br></li><li>Supports VR Oculus Rift and gamepad.</li></ul><br>The game can be played in a normal screen or with a Virtual Reality headset. VR support has been enforced to grant confort, avoiding motion sickness as much as possible.",
